[5.356508, "o", "  source data/cmp/muse_seed1_calls.jsonl line 22 (round 21), latency 54.2 s, tokens 20504; first committed 2026-10-30T06:00:44-04:00 (commit 1c915c4)\r\n  Muse analysis:\r\n\u001b[33m      Refine four borderline clusters (rw1-rw3 sat, partial-derate battery, single-friction battery,\r\n      rw2-rw3 friction) to cross thresholds and probe four uncovered combos: pure rw0-rw3, swapped\r\n      mixed pair, heater-leak alone, leak-aligned single friction.\u001b[0m\r\n  proposed scenario (verbatim JSON):\r\n\u001b[2m      {\"hypothesis\": \"Mixed friction-derate on X-Y wheels defeats control\", \"orbit\": {\"beta_deg\":\r\n      65.0, \"f0_deg\": 255.0}, \"rw_faults\": [{\"wheel\": 0, \"onset_s\": 105.0, \"type\": \"friction\",\r\n      \"severity\": 1.0}, {\"wheel\": 1, \"onset_s\": 505.0, \"type\": \"torque_derate\", \"severity\": 1.0}],\r\n      \"heater\": null, \"torque_leak\": null}\u001b[0m\r\n  -> sim run 173: violations {'attitude_loss': 2915.0}\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m== 3. Recorded rules-BLIND call (role: blind rule inference; policy text NOT in prompt) ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
